        <mxCell id="permissions" value="Director may also update beneficiaries, manage NFC cards, record attendance and assistance across the organization.&#10;Caseworker beneficiary operations and reports are restricted to current assignments; attendance and assistance require active records.&#10;Shared actor symbols denote the same roles, not additional accounts. Source: User, BeneficiaryPolicy, ProgramActivityPolicy and inventory.md." style="html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=22;fontColor=#292929;strokeColor=#292929;strokeWidth=1.5;fillColor=#FFFFFF;text;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;align=left;fontSize=21;fontFamily=Arial;fontColor=#292929;strokeColor=#444444;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="1">
