        <mxCell id="classnote" value="+ denotes public Eloquent attributes / operations; [0..1] denotes an optional value. Only relevant attributes and methods are shown.&#10;Association labels name implemented methods or schema foreign keys. Assignment controls access; recorder / creator links preserve historical authorship.&#10;RegistrationRequest is matched by email in application logic; no User association exists. Source: app/Models and migration declarations." style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=20;fontColor=#292929;strokeColor=#A50021;fillColor=#FFFDF8;text;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;fontSize=20;fontFamily=Arial;fontColor=#292929;strokeColor=#444444;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="1">
